{"agent_type":"claude_code","cwd":"/Users/yalina/Desktop/ClaudeCodeProjects/PHP-XRAY-Demo","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","permission_mode":"auto","prompt_id":"dcf4821a-62c3-4974-8b8a-48d17ac89f7a","scratchpad_dir":"/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-yalina-Desktop-ClaudeCodeProjects/060fec8f-87cd-4c32-bc1e-155453095ecb/scratchpad","session_id":"060fec8f-87cd-4c32-bc1e-155453095ecb","tool_input":{"command":"cat \u003e README.md \u003c\u003c'EOF'\n# PHP-XRAY-Demo\n\n\u003e **Intentionally vulnerable.** `composer.json` pins old package versions with known CVEs so JFrog Xray has something to find. Do not deploy this anywhere real.\n\nA tiny PHP app (`/`, `/health`, `/versions`, `/token`) built into a Docker image (`php:7.4-apache-bullseye`). A GitHub Action builds it, scans it with Xray, pushes it to the Artifactory Docker repo `yalin-demo-xray-local` on `solenglatest.jfrog.io`, publishes build-info and runs an Xray build scan.\n\nPinned packages: `guzzlehttp/guzzle` 6.5.5, `guzzlehttp/psr7` 1.8.0, `twig/twig` 2.14.0, `firebase/php-jwt` 5.2.0, `laminas/laminas-diactoros` 2.0.0. Check exact CVEs and severities in Xray.\n\n## Run locally\n\n```bash\ndocker build -t php-xray-demo .\ndocker run --rm -p 8080:80 php-xray-demo\ncurl localhost:8080/health\n```\n\n## CI\n\nRequired repository secrets: `JF_USER`, `JF_TOKEN` (deploy permission on `yalin-demo-xray-local`).\nThe build name `PHP-XRAY-Demo` must be added to Xray indexing (Xray → Scans List → Builds → Add/Remove to Xray) or the build scan reports \"not selected for indexing\".\nImage: `solenglatest.jfrog.io/yalin-demo-xray-local/php-xray-demo:\u003csha | latest | 1.0.0\u003e`.\nEOF\ngit init -q -b main \u0026\u0026 git add -A \u0026\u0026 git commit -q -m \"Add intentionally vulnerable PHP demo with Docker build and JFrog Xray workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\" \u0026\u0026 gh repo create yalinjob/PHP-XRAY-Demo --public --source=. --push --description \"Intentionally vulnerable PHP/Docker demo for JFrog Xray scanning\" 2\u003e\u00261 | tail -3","description":"Commit and create public GitHub repo PHP-XRAY-Demo"},"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_019PkdUHyZ7RFBdH8UDdktZX","transcript_path":"/Users/yalina/.claude/projects/-Users-yalina-Desktop-ClaudeCodeProjects/060fec8f-87cd-4c32-bc1e-155453095ecb.jsonl"}